ignores cancellation and refund entries.\n- **Two iPads suggest different things.** They should: each builds its own profile from its own ledger.\n- **Tests.** `tests/changescore.test.ts` covers the profile, the score, 60 random drawers where the smart plan is exact exactly when the plain one is, and a mutation check that the stock-keeping test fails without the depth weight. `tests/changeimpact.test.ts` covers the worth-it check."
